// A datetime grouped by its date: toDate and toString as groupBy keys, toTime and toDatetime over aggregates
// and keys in having and select, a title built with concat over toString of a date, an integer and a decimal,
// and conversions inside a predicate and a selector.
{
  "from": { "entity": "orders" },
  "groupBy": [
    {
      "alias": "day",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "toDate",
        "type": { "name": "date" },
        "operand": { "source": "orders", "field": "ordered_at", "type": { "name": "datetime" } }
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "paid",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "toString",
        "type": { "name": "string" },
        "operand": { "source": "orders", "field": "is_paid", "type": { "name": "boolean" } }
      }
    }
  ],
  "having": {
    "operator": "greaterThan",
    "type": { "name": "boolean" },
    "left": {
      "operator": "toTime",
      "type": { "name": "time" },
      "operand": {
        "operator": "max",
        "type": { "name": "datetime" },
        "selector": { "source": "orders", "field": "ordered_at", "type": { "name": "datetime" } }
      }
    },
    "right": { "type": { "name": "time" }, "value": "18:00:00" }
  },
  "select": [
    { "alias": "day", "expression": { "key": "day", "type": { "name": "date" } } },
    { "alias": "paid", "expression": { "key": "paid", "type": { "name": "string" } } },
    { "alias": "orders", "expression": { "operator": "count", "type": { "name": "integer" } } },
    {
      "alias": "title",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "concat",
        "type": { "name": "string" },
        "values": [
          {
            "operator": "toString",
            "type": { "name": "string" },
            "operand": { "key": "day", "type": { "name": "date" } }
          },
          { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": ": " },
          {
            "operator": "toString",
            "type": { "name": "string" },
            "operand": { "operator": "count", "type": { "name": "integer" } }
          },
          { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": " orders, " },
          {
            "operator": "toString",
            "type": { "name": "string" },
            "operand": {
              "operator": "sum",
              "type": { "name": "decimal" },
              "selector": { "source": "orders", "field": "total", "type": { "name": "decimal" } }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "first_order_time",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "toTime",
        "type": { "name": "time" },
        "operand": {
          "operator": "min",
          "type": { "name": "datetime" },
          "selector": { "source": "orders", "field": "ordered_at", "type": { "name": "datetime" } }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "day_start",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "toDatetime",
        "type": { "name": "datetime" },
        "operand": { "key": "day", "type": { "name": "date" } }
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "shipped_days",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "count",
        "type": { "name": "integer" },
        "predicate": {
          "operator": "equal",
          "type": { "name": "boolean" },
          "left": {
            "operator": "toDate",
            "type": { "name": "date" },
            "operand": { "source": "orders", "field": "shipped_at", "type": { "name": "datetime" } }
          },
          "right": { "source": "orders", "field": "order_date", "type": { "name": "date" } }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "longest_total",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "max",
        "type": { "name": "integer" },
        "selector": {
          "operator": "length",
          "type": { "name": "integer" },
          "operand": {
            "operator": "toString",
            "type": { "name": "string" },
            "operand": { "source": "orders", "field": "total", "type": { "name": "decimal" } }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "orderBy": [
    { "expression": { "key": "day", "type": { "name": "date" } }, "direction": "desc" },
    { "expression": { "key": "paid", "type": { "name": "string" } } }
  ]
}
